  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat. Cook the onion 3-5 min until softened, then add the garlic and jalapeño and cook 1 min.",
    "Add the whole chicken breasts, paprika, cumin, garlic powder, salt and pepper and stir to coat.",
    "Add the crushed tomatoes and broth, cover, and bring to a boil. Boil gently 15 min.",
    "Add the black beans and corn and boil 10 min more, until the chicken reaches 165°F in the thickest part.",
    "Lift out the chicken, shred it in a bowl with two forks, and return it to the pot. Taste and add salt; this soup needs more seasoning than you expect.",
    "Serve with avocado, cilantro, tortilla chips, Greek yogurt and cheese."
  ],
